==Description==
[[Category:Race]]
'''Races''' are a part of character creation in [[:Voxlblade Wiki|Voxlblade]] each providing bonuses to your character.

While most races start automatically unlocked at character creation, some are only available via gamepass, or unlocked through in-game achievements.

After creating a character, you are only able to change your race using the [[Lost_Shrine#tabber-Shrine_of_Change|Shrine of Change]].

