==Additional Notes==
This race is the only one with the ability to join the [[Draconic|Draconic Guild]], however it is possible to use the [[Lost_Shrine#tabber-Shrine_of_Change|Shrine of Change]] to become any other race after joining the guild.
*(1) Red is <b style="color: rgb(255, 88, 5);">Fire</b>
*(2) White is <b style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Air</b>
*(3) Green is <b style="color: rgb(132, 89, 54);">Earth</b>
*(4) Blue is <b style="color: rgb(73, 128, 255);">Water</b>
*(5) Yellow is <b style="color: rgb(238, 255, 46);">Holy</b>
*(6) Purple is <b style="color: rgb(123, 8, 255);">Hex</b>

