|-|Arborian=
{{Race
|Race Name = ARBORIAN
|Image = Arborian1.png,
Arborian2.png,
Arborian3.png,
Arborian4.png,
Arborian5.png,
Arborian6.png
|Race Description = The Arborians are druidic in nature. They are trees made of tough bark and use their power to protect all life
|Race Passive = -50% Fire Defense, +15 Protection, passive regen that is boosted in the sun, and a chance to entangle foes on hit.
}}
==Passive Details==
<div class="raceDetails">
<p>Healing whilst in sun is 0.41% per second.</p>
<p>Attacks have a 5% chance to entangle enemies for 1 second, which deals 2 earth damage, 50 poise damage and prevents the enemy from attacking or moving.</p>
<p>Entangle damage does not scale with level but scales with any other damage boost or debuff.</p>
<p>You can still regenerate in the darkness, but at a reduced rate.</p>
<p>Being [[Vampire]] will cause you to regenerate in the darkness at the full rate, but regenerate in the sunlight at a reduced rate.</p>
</div>

==Additional Notes==
Unlocked via the [https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/36304725/Arborian Arborian gamepass] for 50 robux.

You cannot join [[Vampire]] as an Arborian, however it is possible to be a '''Vampire''' and '''Arborian''' at the same time using the [[Lost_Shrine#tabber-Shrine_of_Change|Shrine of Change]] to become an Arborian after joining the guild.

